# --- Large / third-party local assets: 不入库 ---
# This repository is published as code + docs + regenerable results only.
# The paths below are excluded for third-party licensing and/or GitHub's
# 100 MB single-file limit (one over-limit blob permanently breaks push).
#
# model/   ~326 MB  ALL third-party geometry / finite-element models:
#   - OpenSim FullBodyModel 4.0                        (model/opensim/)
#   - IITD Ankle-foot NLSR-class .OSIM models          (model/Model/)
#     + FootwithinLowerlimb geometry incl. ~12 MB STL  (model/FootwithinLowerlimbModel/)
#   - Toyota THUMS AM50 V71 occupant model             (model/AM50_V71_Occupant/)
#     incl. THUMS_AM50_V71_Occupant_202411.k ≈ 219 MB
#   Excluded for third-party licensing; also far above GitHub's 100 MB file
#   limit. Obtain these models from their original distributors.
# paper/   ~163 MB  literature PDFs / zips (third-party copyright; not redistributable).
#
# Regenerable simulation artefacts (safe to delete — reproduced by scripts):
#   *.feb *.xplt *.log                    FEBio input/output + solver logs
#   *.msh *.stl *.obj                     generated meshes / geometry exports
#   *.hdf5 *.h5 *.npz *.npy *.vtp *.vtk   field-data / post-processing dumps
#   *.c3d                                 motion-capture trials
#   *.mp4                                 rendered animations
